# PANG workspace — root .gitignore.
#
# The app (`pang-2026/`) carries its own `.gitignore` with every
# Next.js / Turbopack / Vercel exclusion (node_modules, .next,
# .env*.local, fonts, OPFS scratch). This file covers the workspace
# wrapper: doctrine docs, the archive, and local tooling state.
#
# Philosophy: we version the nine doctrine docs + the app. We do NOT
# version the 696M `_archive/` (legacy prototypes, reference HTML,
# gallery-page scrapes) — it's read-only local reference; if anything
# there ever earns its way back in, it gets absorbed into one of the
# nine docs per CLAUDE.md § 3, not merged wholesale.

# --- Workspace wrapper --------------------------------------------

# Editor-agent session state.
#
# `.claude/settings.json` is shared (committed) — it holds the dev-loop
# allow-list every contributor and every fresh Claude Code session needs,
# so known-safe commands stop re-prompting. See that file's header for
# the rules on what belongs there vs. `settings.local.json`.
#
# Everything else in `.claude/` is per-machine state: the local
# permissions overlay, scheduled-task locks, editor launch config.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

# Legacy prototypes + reference scrapes. Kept locally for lookups.
_archive/

# macOS metadata.
.DS_Store

# Editor swap / index / idea / vscode dumps.
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
